   "notes": [
    "Capo 2, G shapes (sounds in A). 115 BPM, timed to your MP3 (first beat 0.78 s; bar lines re-checked against the bass and chord changes on 2026-11-12).",
    "Strumming (your tutorial): keep the hand moving in 16ths and play D D U | D U D | D U D | D U D — 12 strokes, 4 misses. Counted from beat 1 of the bar: D . d u d . D . d u d u D . d u — the tutorial's cycle starts on the & of 2. Accent beat 1 (the heaviest hit in the recording), the & of 2 and beat 4.",
    "Intro strum G ↔ Gsus2 (capo 2; A ↔ Asus2 in the tutorial): keep strumming and lift your index finger on the first up-stroke of part 3, put it back on the last up-stroke of part 4. Gsus2 = 3x0233.",
    "Intro lick on the B and G strings (capo 2): B 0-2-3-5-3/5p3-2-0, then G 2-2, B 5-5; second time end G 2-2-2, B 2-0.",
    "'Oh shaanti' lines: Am (1 beat) G (2 beats) D (1 beat), then a full bar of D.",
    "Hard chords: Bm → Bm7 (x20202) or D/F#; F → Fmaj7 (xx3210)."
   ],
